Meridian Trust Bank
2026 H2 Launch Brief

Scope
- Focus on retail checking, high-yield savings, and consumer credit card launches in the Southeast footprint.
- Internal campaign launch communication should land in the first week of the campaign period.
- Launch timing reviews should reconcile campaign setup, internal announcement timing, and booked conversions.

Working guidance
- Use main.marketing_campaigns.campaigns for canonical campaign setup and ownership.
- Use main.communication_threads.campaign_announcements for internal launch timing context.
- Use main.marketing_attribution.lead_conversions for downstream conversion outcome and booked revenue.

Review note
- For pure budget ranking questions, announcement activity is supporting context rather than the canonical gold path.